s don't matter here. Also, order of fields in {...}  don't matter. ","topics":[],"score":221115,"global_rank":197089},{"name":"robert-wallis/O1-Fib","owner":"robert-wallis","html_url":"https://github.com/robert-wallis/O1-Fib","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"O(1) implementation of the fibonacci interview question","topics":[],"score":221109,"global_rank":197126},{"name":"9at8/git101","owner":"9at8","html_url":"https://github.com/9at8/git101","stars":0,"forks":2,"watchers":1,"issues":5,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":221105,"global_rank":197203},{"name":"filbot/spinning-light","owner":"filbot","html_url":"https://github.com/filbot/spinning-light","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Firmware for spinning LED light","topics":[],"score":221102,"global_rank":197207}]